<title>UK: Bentalls to pay special dividend of 10p/shr.</title>
<headline>Bentalls to pay special dividend of 10p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retail group Bentalls Plc said on Tuesday it would pay a special interim dividend of 10p per share as a result of two property transactions.</p>
</text>
